## Input

```css
$bound: min;
@media ($bound + : 30rem) { .missing-operand { color: red; } }
.after-operand { color: green; }
@import "wide-layout.css" screen and ($bound + "-width":);
@media (width: 30rem) { .after-value { color: green; } }
@media ($bound + "-width": 30rem { .missing-close { color: red; } }
.after-close { color: green; }
@import "wide-layout.css" screen and ($bound + "-width": 30rem;
@media (color) { .after-import { color: green; } }

```


